                                                               },
                                                      "url":  "{{baseUrl}}/backtest/download-and-run-suite",
                                                      "description":  "Full-year strategy analysis. Omitting variants makes the server run every default variant combination for the 1-year window. The response includes suite-summary.csv, suite-variant-ranking.csv, suite-period-performance.csv/json, and suite-report.html under C:/data/backtest/results/suites/\u003csuite-id\u003e."
